  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Symposium - Energy Resiliency Virtual Workshop Series, through IHS, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a technical symposium for the U.S.-India Foundation (USIN), a nonprofit focused on the commercial and economic relationship between the U.S. and India, through a series of virtual workshops on the effects of the COVID-19 pandemic and climate considerations on the future of the Indian energy sector. The series of ten virtual workshops will serve as a platform to bring together U.S. and Indian public and private sector energy entities to advance and promote new areas of investment and cooperation in India.</narrative>
  </description>
